    "claim": "In 096988dd every failure was the policy's own. The route command was RIGHT (or STRAIGHT and then RIGHT), but the ego slowed, drifted left out of its lane and drove its front into actor 41, a pickup passing in the left lane. Actor 41 is not the retimed car (track 2).",
    "settings": [
     "S5"
    ]
