    "claim": "Confirmed case 2, scene 19f339ba: car on time at 1.25x, ego at 1.4x. Every run failed, and the range lies above 0.5. With the ego at 1.0x or 1.2x, or with the car at 1.5x and the ego at 1.2x, no run failed. Each of those settings has only one run, so these are hints, not rates.",
    "settings": [
     "S29",
