   },
   {
    "claim": "In 19f339ba every failure was the policy braking hard for no visible reason, with the nearest car ahead 40 m or more away and pulling off. While braking it drifted left, and its front-left corner swung into actor 1 coming up in the left lane. Some runs also show a rear-end contact from traffic behind; that is a consequence of the braking for nothing and not counted as the failure.",
